      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a stressful and unsettling series of events. Being terminated from a job can sometimes lead to unexpected consequences if you left any company property behind or had ongoing obligations. I recommend checking your paperwork to see if there's anything you might have missed. As for the suspicious activity on your bank account, it’s a good idea to report this to your bank and they can help you investigate further. Keep your phone line secure and consider changing passwords if you're concerned about privacy. Seeking advice from a professional who specializes in employment or identity theft could also be helpful in resolving these issues.",
