      "role": "user",
      "content": "the legal advisor thing... i tried calling a specialist yesterday and my line just kept dropping, and then my landline went dead right after. it's getting scary. it's not just about \"malfeasance\" anymore, it feels like they are actually trying to erase me. like they want me to just disappear so the data i saw stays buried. if they can control my money and my ID, how am i supposed to even prove i exist to the world? it feels like a coordinated effort to make me look like i'm just losing my mind.",
